        }
      ],
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "content.root"
          }
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "concept-class",
          "nodeId": "concept"
        },
        "markdown": "Concept captures unresolved issues that block clarity.\n\nAuthored fields: `label`, `body`, `status`, `owner`, `resolutionPath`, `prominence`.\n\nThe detail surface represents the full editor contract; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "Concept is one thing to know, and how well it is known.\n\nAuthored fields: `title`, `body`, `confidence`, `check`.\n\nEvery card of the Learn-a-topic template carries `check`: set it when you are not sure it is right, so the study guide can show what still needs checking."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
